[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15120.469, "timestamp": "04:12:00", "text": "找到它。你知道，我只是……我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15123.03, "timestamp": "04:12:03", "text": "记住P开头的人的名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15125.83, "timestamp": "04:12:05", "text": "呃，我觉得首先是精神病患者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15127.75, "timestamp": "04:12:07", "text": "其中一个对精神病患者之类的很友好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15131.03, "timestamp": "04:12:11", "text": "我个人非常喜欢。萨凡纳是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15134.229, "timestamp": "04:12:14", "text": "与萨凡纳一起。我认为那就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15138.309, "timestamp": "04:12:18", "text": "大多数人都加入了，因为她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15140.79, "timestamp": "04:12:20", "text": "已经很久没直播了，而你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15143.03, "timestamp": "04:12:23", "text": "把她带到你的小溪边，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15151.429, "timestamp": "04:12:31", "text": "所以，那就像十字架一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15153.99, "timestamp": "04:12:33", "text": "前五名，但你又不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15156.79, "timestamp": "04:12:36", "text": "对我来说，第一点是我认为是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15161.11, "timestamp": "04:12:41", "text": "和Cherry一起，你就能懂日语了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15173.91, "timestamp": "04:12:53", "text": "合作者就是在场的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15176.63, "timestamp": "04:12:56", "text": "聊天记录和你们玩得很开心。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15179.91, "timestamp": "04:12:59", "text": "那真不错。好吧，再给我一次。"}]